<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Morgan raises Intl Network.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Morgan raises Intl Network.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it raised International Network Services to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/4 to 24-1/2.</p>
<p>-- The Sunnyvale, California company provides services for complex enterprise networks. It went public in September for $16 a share, began trading near 30 and rose as high as 51-7/8 in October. But the share price has been on a downtrend since and yesterday closed off to 2-1/4 to 23-3/4.</p>
</text>
